Package: phymapr
Type: Package
Title: Phylogenetic Transmission Mapping, Epidemiologic Inference, and Animation
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Taylor Martins <taylor.martins@azdhs.gov>
Maintainer: Taylor Martins <taylor.martins@azdhs.gov>
Description: Advanced phylogeographic analysis pipeline for time-scaled phylogenetic trees and spatial metadata. Performs ancestral state reconstruction (ASR), collapses regional stays into local residence episodes, classifies transmission pathway confidence using multivariate genetic and temporal features, applies blended non-linear animation pacing, and generates animated geographic transmission maps.
